":"executing synchronous function is actually executing on the serial","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"executor of the this (local) distributed actor.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If that is the case, the operation is invoked isolated to the main actor","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"@MainActor () -> T","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), allowing synchronous access to actor local state","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without hopping through asynchronous boundaries.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the current context is not running on the actor’s serial executor,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this method will crash with a fatal error (similar","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Distributed\/DistributedActor\/preconditionIsolated(_:file:line:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method can only be used from synchronous functions, as asynchronous","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"functions should instead perform a normal method call to the actor, which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"will hop task execution to the target actor if necessary.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because this check is performed against the actor’s serial executor,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if another actor uses the same serial executor–by using"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another actor’s executor as its own "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Distributed\/DistributedActor\/unownedExecutor","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"–this check will succeed.  From a concurrency safety perspective,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the serial executor guarantees mutual exclusion of those two actors."}]}],"style":"note"},{"name":"Throws","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The error thrown by the operation, if it threw"}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/StaticString":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StaticString"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/StaticString","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/staticstring","abstract":[{"text":"A string type designed to represent text that is known at compile time.","type":"text"}],"title":"StaticString","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StaticString"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Distributed":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Distributed","url":"\/documentation\/distributed","title":"Distributed","abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/Error":{"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/error","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Error","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Error","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Error","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type representing an error value that can be thrown."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Distributed/DistributedActor/unownedExecutor":{"url":"\/documentation\/distributed\/distributedactor\/unownedexecutor","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unownedExecutor","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sce","text":"UnownedSerialExecutor","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Retrieve the executor for this distributed actor as an optimized,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unowned reference. This API is equivalent to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Actor.unownedExecutor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"however, by default, it intentionally returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if this actor is a reference","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to a remote distributed actor, because the executor for remote references","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is effectively never going to execute any code “on” this actor’s isolated state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(because it is located on a remote)."}],"required":true,"title":"unownedExecutor","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Distributed\/DistributedActor\/unownedExecutor"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Distributed/DistributedActor/preconditionIsolated(_:file:line:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Distributed\/DistributedActor\/preconditionIsolated(_:file:line:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"preconditionIsolated"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@autoclosure"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"file"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12StaticStringV","text":"StaticString"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"line"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Su","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt"},{"kind":"text","text